      en: ["Year of establishment: Circa 1400", "UNESCO status: Inscribed in 2008", "Total population: Approx. 500,000", "Historical name: Malacca Sultanate capital", "Stadthuys: Built in 1650 as the Dutch Governor's office", "Jonker Street: Famous for Friday/Saturday night markets", "Taming Sari: First gyro tower in Malaysia (110m)", "Maritime history: Center of global spice trade for 500 years"],
