      en: ["Land area: 92 square kilometers", "Total population: Approx. 100,000", "Date of British cession: 1846", "Financial center status: Established in 1990", "Shipwrecks: Four major wrecks popular for diving", "Air connectivity: Labuan Airport connects to KL and Sabah", "Marine park: Labuan Marine Park covers 10 square km", "History: Site of Japanese surrender in WWII (1945)"],
